This is a fork of github.com/vectorcore-mobile/vectorcore-ePDG (upstream commit 76a929c),
maintained by itskimffs. The BPF header files under internal/gtpu/bpf/headers/ are adapted from
the eUPF project by Edgecom LLC, used under the Apache License 2.0 (see README.md).

Modifications in this fork (itskimffs, 2026-10); each modified file carries a notice:
- RFC 2409 DH group 2 (1024-bit MODP) in IKEv2 proposals
  (internal/ikev2/crypto.go, internal/ikev2/proposal.go)
- RFC 5998 EAP-only authentication: no CERT/AUTH payload when the UE requests it
  (internal/ikev2/auth.go, internal/ikev2/sa.go)
- unique XFRM reqid per UE derived from the PAA, so several UEs behind the same NAT get their own
  SA (internal/xfrm/xfrm.go)
- NAT-T: NAT detection in IKE_SA_INIT hashes SPIr = 0 as the initiator does (RFC 7296 2.23), and
  the SA follows the UE's IKE_AUTH port for UDP encapsulation (internal/ikev2/init.go,
  internal/ikev2/auth.go)
- DPD: the outstanding probe is kept until the UE answers that Message ID and retransmitted
  bitwise identical, a UE request no longer cancels it, and the UE's response is authenticated
  before it is accepted; liveness (lastSeen) only counts authenticated messages
  (RFC 7296 2.1, 2.3, 2.4) (internal/ikev2/inform.go, internal/ikev2/sa.go,
  internal/ikev2/rekey.go, internal/ikev2/dpd_retransmit_test.go)
- PDN_TYPE_IPv4_ONLY_ALLOWED Notify in the final IKE_AUTH response when the UE requested both an
  IPv4 address and an IPv6 prefix and only IPv4 is assigned (TS 24.302 7.4.1)
  (internal/ikev2/auth.go, internal/ikev2/sa.go)
- IPv6 PDN connections: when the UE requests only INTERNAL_IP6_ADDRESS, PDN type IPv6 on S2b,
  INTERNAL_IP6_ADDRESS and the requested IPv6 DNS/P-CSCF attributes in CFG_REPLY, IPv6 traffic
  selectors, an IPv6 SA selector over the IPv4 tunnel, and inner IPv6 in the XDP/TC programs keyed
  by the UE's /64 prefix (TS 24.302 7.2.2/7.4.1, TS 29.274 8.14, RFC 7296 3.15.1)
  (internal/ikev2/auth.go, internal/ikev2/sa.go, internal/ikev2/inform.go, internal/ikev2/rekey.go,
  internal/ikev2/paa6.go, internal/s2b/codec.go, internal/s2b/client.go, internal/xfrm/xfrm.go,
  internal/gtpu/dataplane.go, internal/gtpu/bpf_loader.go, internal/gtpu/tc_loader.go,
  internal/gtpu/bpf/xdp_gtpu_decap.c, internal/gtpu/bpf/tc_gtpu_encap.c and tests)
- Uplink TFT for IPv6 PDN connections and TFT packet filter component types per TS 24.008
  Table 10.5.162: IPv4 local address is 0x11 (was 0x18), IPv6 remote address (0x20), IPv6 remote
  address/prefix length (0x21) and IPv6 local address/prefix length (0x23); the TC program selects
  the dedicated bearer for inner IPv6 with rules keyed by the UE's /64 prefix
  (internal/gtpu/dataplane.go, internal/gtpu/tc_loader.go, internal/gtpu/bpf/tc_gtpu_encap.c,
  internal/gtpu/tft_test.go, internal/gtpu/ipv6_tft_test.go)
